D7D7AF]existing successor-group behavior.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Note-pull copy, human output, and block reporting[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]presentation[dim] · [dim][/dim]after batch[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]presentation: implement section 6, including note-pull groups and copy, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]human success and refusal output, task and Pomodoro block reasons, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CLI help regeneration. Pin approved wording, lane names, mixed-group [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]behavior, and additive JSON.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Note-pull conformance fixtures and performance evidence[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]verification[dim] · [dim][/dim]after presentation[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verification: complete section 7, audit NP1–NP28, add CLI fixture [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]assertions, generate real-bob JSON fixtures for the Mac phase, verify [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dry-run parity and write-free refusals, measure release latency on an [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]isolated vault copy, and run just check plus just docs-check. Prepare [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]closure evidence for bob-cli-gj.2; this phase closes only its own bead.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-gj.2.1","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-gj.2.1.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-1515b74cce237739e9ae2173dc8acdff","started_at":"2026-11-03T17:43:54.877230+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"4ba3cd54cb0dedbda8d113940b99544e06c2a72a1b4e9f4f11