endencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: write the docs-first contract for the note pull. Cover the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar row, the new capture.md section, the capture-parse and JSON [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shapes, task-dependencies §12.20/§12.21 with the NP vectors and copy [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]table, the reference pages (grammar 7), and any accepted memory updates.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli note pull grammar, planner, picks, and output[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: implement the lone-header `note_pull` kind in the capture language [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and capture-parse. Build the staged planner that classifies residents, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]keys, orders, places, and writes picks; wire it into pull-in numbering, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the net pass, refusals, inbox routing, JSON, and human output; add tests[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for every NP vector.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture note-pull preview, card, and notification[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: decode `note_pull` results and render them. Covers the preview card[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with the Pull In verb, the Pull-In card glyph, tint, lanes, and footer, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the calm empty state, the Shift-Return list helper, and notifications. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Includes fixtures captured from the real bob and compiled, tested Swift.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-gj","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-gj.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-gj.